{
  "title": "Two clients, one permission request: the first answer wins",
  "description": "Section 10. A phone and a laptop watch the same session. The laptop answers; the phone's copy of the request is withdrawn with ACP $/cancel_request; both see it resolved; a late answer is refused plainly.",
  "steps": [
    {"note": "Open a connection to the host (through its relay, or on the LAN).", "conn": "phone", "connect": "host"},
    {"note": "The first frame is host/hello: the versions this client speaks and the device credential from pairing.", "conn": "phone", "send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "host/hello", "params": {"protocol": {"min": "0.1", "max": "0.1"}, "client": {"name": "oal-conformance", "version": "0.1.0"}, "auth": {"type": "device", "deviceId": "{{deviceId}}", "token": "{{token}}"}}}},
    {"note": "The host picks 0.1 and says which device this connection is. `info` is the same object host/info returns.", "conn": "phone", "expect": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"protocol": "0.1", "device": {"id": "{{deviceId}}"}, "info": {"host": {"id": "{{hostId}}"}}}}},
    {"note": "ACP starts every agent channel with initialize. The host answers it itself with the agent's capabilities; the client's are not passed on.", "conn": "phone", "send": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "acp": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "initialize", "params": {"protocolVersion": 1, "clientCapabilities": {"fs": {"readTextFile": false, "writeTextFile": false}, "terminal": false}, "clientInfo": {"name": "oal-conformance", "version": "0.1.0"}}}}},
    {"note": "ACP protocol version 1. No sign-in methods: the agent runs under its owner's own sign-in on the host.", "conn": "phone", "expect": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "acp": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"protocolVersion": 1, "agentCapabilities": {"loadSession": true}, "authMethods": []}}}},
    {"note": "ACP session/new, unchanged. cwd is the agent's folder from host/agents; a remote client can't pick another folder or add MCP servers that run commands.", "conn": "phone", "send": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "acp": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "method": "session/new", "params": {"cwd": "{{folder}}", "mcpServers": []}}}},
    {"note": "The agent's own session id and modes. This connection is now attached to the session.", "conn": "phone", "expect": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "acp": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "result": {"sessionId": "{{session}}", "modes": {"currentModeId": "ask", "availableModes": [{"id": "ask"}, {"id": "folder"}, {"id": "full"}]}}}}},
    {"note": "Open a connection to the host (through its relay, or on the LAN).", "conn": "laptop", "connect": "host"},
    {"note": "The first frame is host/hello: the versions this client speaks and the device credential from pairing.", "conn": "laptop", "send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "host/hello", "params": {"protocol": {"min": "0.1", "max": "0.1"}, "client": {"name": "oal-conformance", "version": "0.1.0"}, "auth": {"type": "device", "deviceId": "{{deviceId}}", "token": "{{token}}"}}}},
    {"note": "The host picks 0.1 and says which device this connection is. `info` is the same object host/info returns.", "conn": "laptop", "expect": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"protocol": "0.1", "device": {"id": "{{deviceId}}"}, "info": {"host": {"id": "{{hostId}}"}}}}},
    {"note": "ACP starts every agent channel with initialize. The host answers it itself with the agent's capabilities; the client's are not passed on.", "conn": "laptop", "send": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "acp": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "initialize", "params": {"protocolVersion": 1, "clientCapabilities": {"fs": {"readTextFile": false, "writeTextFile": false}, "terminal": false}, "clientInfo": {"name": "oal-conformance", "version": "0.1.0"}}}}},
    {"note": "ACP protocol version 1. No sign-in methods: the agent runs under its owner's own sign-in on the host.", "conn": "laptop", "expect": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "acp": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"protocolVersion": 1, "agentCapabilities": {"loadSession": true}, "authMethods": []}}}},
    {"note": "The laptop attaches to the phone's session with session/load. Nothing has happened yet, so nothing is replayed.", "conn": "laptop", "send": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "acp": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "method": "session/load", "params": {"sessionId": "{{session}}", "cwd": "{{folder}}", "mcpServers": []}}}},
    {"note": "Attached.", "conn": "laptop", "expect": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "acp": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "result": {"modes": {"currentModeId": "ask"}}}}},
    {"note": "The phone sends the prompt.", "conn": "phone", "send": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "acp": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "method": "session/prompt", "params": {"sessionId": "{{session}}", "prompt": [{"type": "text", "text": "run: echo hi"}]}}}},
    {"note": "The turn starts...", "conn": "phone", "expect": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "host/turn", "params": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "sessionId": "{{session}}", "turnId": "{{turn}}", "state": "running"}}},
    {"note": "...for both.", "conn": "laptop", "expect": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "host/turn", "params": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "sessionId": "{{session}}", "turnId": "{{turn}}", "state": "running"}}},
    {"note": "The laptop sees the phone's prompt, echoed by the host as ACP user_message_chunk.", "conn": "laptop", "expect": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "acp": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "{{session}}", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "user_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "run: echo hi"}}}}}},
    {"note": "Both get the tool call.", "conn": "phone", "expect": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "acp": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "{{session}}", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "tool_call", "toolCallId": "{{call}}", "title": "echo hi", "kind": "execute", "status": "pending"}}}}},
    {"note": "Both get the tool call.", "conn": "laptop", "expect": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "acp": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "{{session}}", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "tool_call", "toolCallId": "{{call}}", "title": "echo hi", "kind": "execute", "status": "pending"}}}}},
    {"note": "The pending list gains the request.", "conn": "phone", "expect": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "host/pending_update", "params": {"change": "added", "request": {"id": "{{pending}}", "agent": "{{agent}}", "sessionId": "{{session}}", "turnId": "{{turn}}", "toolCall": {"toolCallId": "{{call}}"}, "options": [{"optionId": "allow-once", "kind": "allow_once"}, {"optionId": "reject-once", "kind": "reject_once"}]}}}},
    {"note": "Both get the permission request, each with its own id.", "conn": "phone", "expect": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "acp": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "{{phoneReq}}", "method": "session/request_permission", "params": {"sessionId": "{{session}}", "toolCall": {"toolCallId": "{{call}}", "title": "echo hi"}, "options": [{"optionId": "allow-once", "kind": "allow_once"}, {"optionId": "reject-once", "kind": "reject_once"}]}}}},
    {"note": "Both get the permission request, each with its own id.", "conn": "laptop", "expect": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "acp": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "{{laptopReq}}", "method": "session/request_permission", "params": {"sessionId": "{{session}}", "toolCall": {"toolCallId": "{{call}}", "title": "echo hi"}, "options": [{"optionId": "allow-once", "kind": "allow_once"}, {"optionId": "reject-once", "kind": "reject_once"}]}}}},
    {"note": "The laptop answers first.", "conn": "laptop", "send": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "acp": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "{{laptopReq}}", "result": {"outcome": {"outcome": "selected", "optionId": "allow-once"}}}}},
    {"note": "The phone's copy is withdrawn with ACP's $/cancel_request.", "conn": "phone", "expect": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "acp": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "$/cancel_request", "params": {"requestId": "{{phoneReq}}"}}}},
    {"note": "The phone answers the withdrawn request with -32800, as ACP requires.", "conn": "phone", "send": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "acp": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "{{phoneReq}}", "error": {"code": -32800, "message": "Request cancelled"}}}},
    {"note": "Both see it resolved, answered by the laptop's device (the same device here).", "conn": "phone", "expect": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "host/pending_update", "params": {"change": "resolved", "request": {"id": "{{pending}}"}, "outcome": {"outcome": "selected", "optionId": "allow-once"}, "answeredBy": {"deviceId": "{{deviceId}}"}}}},
    {"note": "Both see it resolved.", "conn": "laptop", "expect": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "host/pending_update", "params": {"change": "resolved", "request": {"id": "{{pending}}"}, "outcome": {"outcome": "selected", "optionId": "allow-once"}, "answeredBy": {"deviceId": "{{deviceId}}"}}}},
    {"note": "A late answer from the phone's inbox, by pending id...", "conn": "phone", "send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 5, "method": "host/answer", "params": {"id": "{{pending}}", "optionId": "reject-once"}}},
    {"note": "...is refused with already_answered and a plain message.", "conn": "phone", "expect": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 5, "error": {"code": -33007, "message": "{{*}}"}}},
    {"note": "The result streams to both.", "conn": "phone", "expect": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "acp": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "{{session}}", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "tool_call_update", "toolCallId": "{{call}}", "status": "completed", "content": [{"type": "content", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "hi"}}]}}}}},
    {"note": "The result streams to both.", "conn": "laptop", "expect": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "acp": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "{{session}}", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "tool_call_update", "toolCallId": "{{call}}", "status": "completed", "content": [{"type": "content", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "hi"}}]}}}}},
    {"note": "The reply.", "conn": "phone", "expect": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "acp": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "{{session}}", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "Done."}}}}}},
    {"note": "The phone's prompt is answered.", "conn": "phone", "expect": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "acp": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": {"stopReason": "end_turn"}}}},
    {"note": "The turn ends for both.", "conn": "phone", "expect": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "host/turn", "params": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "sessionId": "{{session}}", "turnId": "{{turn}}", "state": "ended", "stopReason": "end_turn", "usage": {"inputTokens": 12, "outputTokens": 5, "totalTokens": 17}}}},
    {"note": "The turn ends for both.", "conn": "laptop", "expect": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "host/turn", "params": {"agent": "{{agent}}", "sessionId": "{{session}}", "turnId": "{{turn}}", "state": "ended", "stopReason": "end_turn", "usage": {"inputTokens": 12, "outputTokens": 5, "totalTokens": 17}}}}
  ]
}
